# RoboCasa + ACT policy runtime for CPython 3.12 on linux/amd64.
#
# LeRobot is hash-locked separately and installed with --no-deps because its
# Gymnasium and OpenCV environment dependencies conflict with RoboCasa's
# validated simulator API. Robosuite is installed separately from an immutable
# Git commit so its direct_url.json can bind the checkout.
